WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.100
I'll never accept him!

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.170
Whether you accept him or not, 
according to the register,

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.450
Ren is the fourth son of the Kaidou family.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.740
He's our brother. Get used to it.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.740
Kaidou Family Brothers 
Eldest Son, Haru

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.360
How? I just learned of this today!

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:19.940
I'd have an easier time 
accepting you having a kid!

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.930
Kaidou Family Brothers 
Second Son, Aki

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.870
Don't you think that's kinda mean?

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.820
Does that mean our parents 
adopted him before they died?

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:27.750
Kaidou Family Brothers 
Third Son, Shima

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.750
A child they'd never even met?

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:32.510
I met a Japanese couple matching their 
description at the orphanage in Canada.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:32.510
Kaidou Family Brothers 
Fourth Son, Ren

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.510
In Canada?

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.950
Come to think of it, they did 
take a trip there together.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:38.510
Yeah.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:41.590
<i>But I don't remember them very well,</i>

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.020
<i>because I was constantly running from them.</i>

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:50.080
<i>I was terrified of people who were 
kind to me for no particular reason...</i>

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:23.700
Ren?

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:24.980
You're too close.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:28.000
You suddenly stopped talking and responding.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.260
Are you not feeling well?

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:32.000
I'm fine.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.070
Ah, so it's your mood that's doing badly.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:38.470
Sorry your big brothers are so mean.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.640
There, there.

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:40.740
Let go!

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:45.260
Hey! Why are you two trying to 
create your own little world?!

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:50.090
I don't like the way he's all over our brother.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:52.020
It's clearly the other way around.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:54.830
Hello?

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.900
Oh, Doumoto-san?

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.530
You don't usually call me directly.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.780
What? Today?

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.480
Okay, got it. Bye.

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.540
What is it, bro? Work?

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.660
Yeah, a customer's asking for me.

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:12.380
Sorry, Ren.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:15.190
We'll go out the next time I have a day off.

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.600
I don't care either way.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.050
Isn't our brother nice?

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:28.530
When he started living with us,

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:30.680
he took care of us all the time.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:36.380
Thinking about it now, I guess
he was probably desperate to fit in.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.890
And the reason he's so nice to you—

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:39.910
I know.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:46.030
I know Haru's nice to me because he's lonely.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.580
He hasn't changed at all.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.110
You...

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:55.050
Shima!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:57.840
Ow, my stomach... I can't help it...

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.470
Never mind. Aki, let's go.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:02.300
Huh?

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.760
Sorry, Brother. We're leaving.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:06.350
Huh?

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.970
We skipped class to come here.

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.420
Our bags are still at school.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.480
What's with those two?

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.600
Aren't you going, too?

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.130
Oh, yeah.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:20.430
Make sure you eat dinner.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:21.110
I will.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.630
And not just rice!

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:23.610
Shut up.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.560
What? You're seeing me off?

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:31.130
Can I give you a goodbye kiss, then?

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.120
Are you supposed to ask for 
permission every time?

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:37.550
Oh, really? You're such a manly guy, Ren.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.750
What are you even—

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.640
Love you!

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:47.720
See you later.

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:53.050
It's not normally a kiss on the lips!

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.730
I've always thought so, but there's
something wrong with him!

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:02.430
<i>It's infuriating how he hasn't changed at all.</i>

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:07.100
<i>He doesn't even remember anything
about me, and still, he...</i>

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:09.680
You're late!

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.620
Huh? Mikiko-san?

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:15.060
Late? The club isn't even open yet.

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:18.160
The owner said we had an important customer.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:22.520
You named my office as your 
emergency contact, remember?

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.880
So now he calls me for help all the time.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.400
Owner Doumoto

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.890
I handled his money and his woman troubles.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.760
We've been in touch ever since.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:30.890
Oh, right...

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:34.270
No wonder I get away with doing so little work.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:35.730
How's Ren?

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:39.020
Oh, just listen to this! He's so cute!

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:41.150
Well, as long as you're okay with it.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:44.090
Ren asked to be with you, after all.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:47.360
I don't mind, but Aki and Shima...

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.240
You still haven't told them?

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:52.200
Actually, they found out 
today and made a huge fuss...

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.900
I'll let you handle that.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:57.400
Just make sure Ren will still
have a place to call home.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:00.540
I know...

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.170
He doesn't remember anything about his parents.

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:10.430
He doesn't know where he was born, 
if he's Japanese, why he was in Canada,

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:15.100
or even why the Kaidou family adopted him.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:17.820
Really?

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.520
I asked him all kinds of questions...

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:24.940
I swear... You're so nice, 
but you can be so insensitive.

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.630
Haru, unlike you,

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:31.450
everything Ren says and does means something.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:37.050
<i>I feel as though I've just been insulted...</i>

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:40.000
Huh? Natsu-san!

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:43.360
You're not usually in Shinjuku at this hour.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.500
Iku, I'm on my way back from work.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.380
Really? Then let's get something to eat!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.100
Your brother's already asleep, right?

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:51.840
Please? Please? Please?

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.410
Fine, but I'm only buying you dinner.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.400
I know!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.710
Yikes.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:04.040
Were they driving drunk 
or not watching the road?

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:04.960
Dad!

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:06.610
Dad, watch out!

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:07.520
In front of you!

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:08.370
Ruri!

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:13.870
Dad? Mom?

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:16.810
The two in front are completely crushed!

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:20.000
The one in the back seat is badly injured!

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:24.880
Wasn't Ren-kun a nice boy?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:29.810
I'd been curious about him since 
Haruko-chan told me there was

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:31.510
an unusual child at the orphanage.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:35.970
She said Quark and Lepton 
had taken quite a liking to him.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:39.020
Those two grew up with you, right?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:42.330
So I knew you had to meet him.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:43.980
Why?

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.630
Well, Haru, aren't you lonely?

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.710
Haru?

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:55.660
Sorry for waking you.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.610
You're pretty drunk.

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.410
Yeah, I do that now and then.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.770
Take your shoes off.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.160
I'm fine.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:07.870
Stand up.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:10.420
I said I'm fine. Leave me alone.

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:13.640
Anyone falling down in the entryway is not fine.

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:14.890
Besides, you—

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:17.930
I said leave me alone!

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:19.960
Haru?

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:21.350
Sorry.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.940
I'm not in good shape...

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:30.650
Ren, I'm going to stay with a friend for a while.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.130
There's money in there.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.150
Haru?

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.480
It's almost Christmas.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:38.840
I'll be drinking outside of work more.

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:42.200
I'll be coming home drunk like this for a while.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:46.420
That can't be good for you, so...

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:49.740
Ren—

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:51.840
Do you really have to?

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:54.290
Even if I tell you not to go?

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:58.150
You're right.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:02.660
I just don't want to be around you.

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.390
<i>If we're together,</i>

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:12.260
<i>I know I'll end up saying 
something I shouldn't...</i>

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:15.280
Natsu-san!

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.660
Wake up already!

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:21.160
How long are you planning 
on staying here, anyway?

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.870
Will your brother be okay by himself?

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:26.760
I left him my entire wallet.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.330
He should be fine.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:33.250
Wow, that's out of character for the 
normally overprotective Natsu-san.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.030
Did you get in a fight?

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:38.090
No. He's more of an adult than I am.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.220
Anyway, what are you doing 
about a change of clothes?

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:46.150
I said I didn't have any, 
and a customer gave me some.

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.900
From shoes to underwear 
and house clothes,

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.900
to shirts and suits

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:48.600
Can I hit you? You're the enemy of all men!

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.110
Speaking of customers... Asakura-san...

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:57.200
You know how you've been taking first shifts, 
and your hours have been irregular lately?

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:01.480
So Asakura-san has been pretty 
persistent about demanding

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.090
to know when you'd be working.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.160
Before, she'd come about once a week,

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.850
but lately, she's there more days than she isn't.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.460
She apparently quit her day job, too.

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:12.490
Huh?

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:16.630
Otherwise, she wouldn't be able 
to come during your second shift.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.140
You'd better watch yourself.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.310
In your case,

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:26.140
I bet women would claim they're pregnant 
after just making eye contact with you.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.140
Yeah, right.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:46.570
Hello.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.460
Is Natsu here?

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:51.040
Natsu?

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:54.340
Oh, right. His real name is Kaidou Haru.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:56.500
Haru's at work.

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:57.590
He's not home?

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.840
Normally, he's home by now.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.100
He hasn't been home for a few days.

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:04.100
Liar.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:06.970
It's true.

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:10.240
You're lying. Everyone always lies.

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:14.300
Why is everyone trying to prevent 
me from seeing Natsu?

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:19.490
I just want to help him because we're alike...

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.490
I don't lie.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:20.360
You're lying!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.610
Move!

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:23.240
Natsu!

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:24.740
Natsu?

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.240
You're here, aren't you?

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.250
How dare you look at me like that?

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.080
How impudent.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:36.180
I feel sorry for Natsu.

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:39.080
He has to work as a host to 
send his brothers to school.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.770
He doesn't really love his brothers.

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:44.400
I understand.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:49.350
After all, I've never felt 
that way about my sister.

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:51.350
Haru's not like you.

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.390
We are the same!

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:58.360
Why do I have to work so hard 
just because I was born first?!

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:00.660
Huh?! Why?!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.060
Why?!

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:04.870
Hey, what's all the—

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:06.450
Whoa! Ren!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.130
What are you doing to Ren?!

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:12.180
I...

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:14.690
Are you okay?

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:15.500
I'm fine...

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.390
You're not fine!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:21.710
Hello?

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:24.890
Bro! How could you leave Ren by himself?

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:29.390
If one of your customers 
kills him, it'll be your fault!

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:36.810
<i>I keep making the same mistakes over and over.</i>

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:38.650
<i>I'm just an idiot.</i>

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.470
Brother!

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:50.280
Bro...

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.500
How'd you get this scratch on your face?

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.080
Let me see it.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.000
Ow...

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.360
Bro...

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.660
Uh, I...

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.340
Asakura-san?

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.080
What are you doing here?

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.980
That's a dumb question!

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:13.540
She's the one who barged in here 
with her shoes on and strangled Ren!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.730
I didn't mean to...

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.560
Could you leave immediately, please?

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:24.240
If you promise not to approach 
me or my brothers again,

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.390
I won't call the police.

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.990
The police?

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:31.360
I just wanted to help you 
because we're so similar...

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.200
You're such a stupid woman.

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:37.500
I'm telling you to leave, you pest.

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:43.590
Bro, are you sure we shouldn't call the cops?

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:45.270
It won't happen again.

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:47.480
There, there. That was scary, wasn't it?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:49.600
Ren?

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.910
What? He has a fever!

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:54.900
<i>I'm sure what he's doing now is meaningless.</i>

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:52.900
Ren!

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.810
No wonder he couldn't fight off a woman.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:00.490
<i>His kind words, his gentle hands...</i>

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:59.140
It did suddenly get cold recently.

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:04.820
<i>By tomorrow, his attitude will change...</i>

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:08.490
<i>So these feelings,</i>

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:12.980
<i>with nowhere to go, have to just disappear...</i>

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:19.750
You're heavy!

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:23.630
Oh, Ren, you're awake?

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:26.130
You still feel a little warm.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.200
You should rest today.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:29.990
I'm fine.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:31.260
Liar.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:34.230
I'll stay home with you today.

00:14:34.230 --> 00:14:36.520
If there's anything you want to eat, I'll make it.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.520
You don't have to.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.020
Oh, really?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:45.030
<i>Things are really awkward 
since it's been about a week.</i>

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:48.440
I-It's almost Christmas, huh?

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.530
The 25th is your birthday, right?

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:53.090
We'll all have to celebrate!

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:59.220
If there's anything you want, 
I'll get it for you.

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:02.060
Come on. You can tell me.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.540
Then I want a Japanese wolf.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.710
Japanese Wolf 
Existence unconfirmed since last sighting in Nara in 1907

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.920
Extinct

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.800
That's impossible!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:13.070
Oh, that's right... You like rice, don't you?

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.650
You like Koshihikari, right?

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:16.390
Okay, you can rest now!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:17.890
I'm not tired!

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.200
Why are you getting in with me?

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.900
Shut up. I'm sleepy.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.520
I haven't been sleeping well lately.

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.120
That's not my problem!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:31.410
But I sleep better when you're with me.

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:36.660
<i>He's such a cruel man...</i>

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:39.910
Merry Christmas!

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:42.300
Merry Christmas!

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:46.580
You're not going on Christmas dates 
with your customers again this year?

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:49.170
Are your brothers more important?

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:52.890
Well, isn't Christmas a family holiday?

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.500
I celebrate with my brothers,

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.530
and it just happens to be 
the youngest's birthday.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:59.800
Then let's party until then!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:00.650
Cheers!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:01.940
Cheers!

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:04.940
Let's see...

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:09.530
I got the cake, and Aki and Shima will 
be happy if I just feed them beef.

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.550
I guess I'll make chirashizushi for Ren.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.400
I'm home.

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:21.040
Ren?

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:22.830
Huh?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.150
Is he at the library again?

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:41.930
Hello?

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:43.420
Is that you, Haru?

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:44.660
Huh? Ren?

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:47.420
That's Mikiko-san's phone, isn't it?

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:48.700
I borrowed it.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.410
Are you finished with work?

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:52.740
I just got home.

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.130
Oh, thanks for the present.

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:58.450
I didn't have any photos of my mom.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.950
Apparently, Rob took a lot of pictures.

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:06.800
Anyway, are you at Mikiko-san's office?

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.340
I'll come pick you up.

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.940
No, I'm at Narita.

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:13.840
International Airport

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.840
Narita? Why?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.340
I'm going back to Canada.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.330
The plane will be leaving soon.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.220
Mikiko brought me here.

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:23.670
What? Why are you going back?

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:24.450
Today?

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.630
But it's Christmas!

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:29.890
Christmas a family holiday, right?

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:32.480
Isn't Haruko-san in Switzerland?

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:35.050
I'm talking about you and the twins.

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:38.210
Who cares about that?

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:39.990
What will you do when you get there?

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:41.270
Won't you be alone?

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:44.620
Rob and Fumie said I could visit them anytime.

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:46.750
They're taking care of the dogs, too.

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:50.130
And? When are you coming back to Japan?

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.130
I won't be coming back to Japan again.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:01.840
Apparently, I can't do anything about 
the register until I become an adult.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:05.390
So I'll be Kaidou Ren for a while longer.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:09.970
Tell the twins to be patient 
for a few more years.

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:11.150
Why?

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:14.090
Did you not like living with me, after all?

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.400
It's not that.

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:18.420
I caused you a lot of trouble.

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:20.070
I feel bad about it.

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:22.160
But I had fun...

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:25.210
Both five summers ago and this time.

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:27.670
But you're leaving me behind, right?

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:28.930
Is this revenge?

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:31.710
No! What do you want me to say?

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.420
How can I say it so you'll understand?

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:37.360
I'm just trying to tell you that I like you!

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:41.930
Then come back here and say it to my face.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:43.910
I can't do that.

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.290
Then I don't believe you.

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.830
Forget it, then.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:51.860
Ren?

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:53.360
Hey, Ren?

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:58.780
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.070
<i>What's wrong with that brat?</i>

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:04.200
<i>He's the one who came into my life,</i>

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.580
<i>and now he's going back to Canada?</i>

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:09.470
I'm just trying to tell you that I like you!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:12.470
I know that...

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:15.930
I understand...

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:20.630
Haru, aren't you lonely?

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:29.130
<i>But he probably noticed that</i>

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.180
<i>I'm emptier than he is...</i>

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.640
<i>Ren, you brat!</i>

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:37.860
<i>Get in the tub!</i>

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:40.120
<i>I told you not to let the dogs on the bed!</i>

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.960
<i>It's covered in mud! 
What are you gonna do about this?</i>

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:44.740
<i>You can wash it.</i>

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.390
<i>He's right.</i>

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.740
Haru's Secret Memories

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.740
My First Summer

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.740
An Exciting and Thrilling DVD

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.740
Warning: Only to be watched by Haru!!

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:47.750
<i>Ugh! Mom!</i>

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.790
He hasn't changed.

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:52.550
<i>Haruko-san... What?</i>

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:55.690
<i>I was just thinking that he's
really taken a liking to you.</i>

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:58.590
<i>Cut it out! He finally fell asleep!</i>

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:02.200
<i>Ah, sorry, Ren.</i>

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.040
<i>Sorry for waking you.</i>

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.640
<i>We won't make any more noise.</i>

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:07.390
<i>Goodnight.</i>

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:11.320
I haven't changed at all, either...

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:14.650
And what kind of face was Haruko-san 
making when she took this?

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.560
How embarrassing.

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:19.400
Brother, the taxi's here.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.070
By the way, where's Aki?

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.870
He said he'd rather die than see you off.

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.180
Oh, really?

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:31.870
Well, since you both got into college, 
I can leave without any regrets.

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:34.690
We wish you'd at least attend graduation.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:36.700
Won't the Sagamis be there?

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:41.570
I guess I'm relieved if you're 
going to see Ren, though.

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:46.140
Someday, I hope we can all live together.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:50.100
Me, too.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:53.100
I just can't get used to sleeping alone.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:54.500
Huh?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:02.610
<i>Nothing has changed since then, after all.</i>

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:06.120
Fuji? What's wrong?

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:09.430
I just turned on the heat.

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:11.620
I'm cold, so stop moving.

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:15.370
And yet, you make me sleep by myself?

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:19.250
Hello, Ren. It's been two months, right?

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:21.260
Wha... How...

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:25.020
I'm going to start working 
on Rob's ranch tomorrow.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:27.170
So I'll be living here now!

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:27.890
What?!

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:30.690
Hey, Ren. Can I kiss you?

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:31.520
No.

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:36.630
Oh, that's right... I'm not supposed to 
ask for permission every time, right?

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:37.520
Haru!

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:42.140
Ren, didn't we both say so, even back then?

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:43.530
Back then?

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:46.030
Do you remember now?

00:21:47.850 --> 00:21:51.570
We can't sleep at night unless we're together.

00:21:54.190 --> 00:21:58.590
<i>After all, our bodies remember.</i>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:40.040
Next Time
